!.vscode/extensions.json
# Shared editor config, not personal preference: it silences the CSS language
# service's false @tailwind/@apply warnings and pins the TS version to the one
# in devDependencies, so the Problems panel agrees with `npm run build` for
# everyone rather than only on the machine it was set up on.
